  characterName: Django Manush
  promptText: My pension is invested in extractive operations linked to child labour.
    Pressing the fund to divest risks cutting my retirement; accepting the investments
    sustains income but perpetuates harm to others.
  leftAnswer: Keeping the pension protects your dignity and security in old age.
  rightAnswer: Pushing to divest refuses profit from harm and honours justice.
